msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Can't believe my braindead vegetable of an ex was in cahoots with that "
"conniving Takeshita..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "It's, like, how pathetic can ya get?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Is everything back to normal now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Yup! Thanks to you, I'm totally in the clear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Nice to know that someone's got my back... and boy am I glad it's you! "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "But ya know... This whole wild fandanglement has taught me somethin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Fan...danglement?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "It's a word I made up. Anyway, remember what I said a while back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"The stuff my mama's been tellin' me... That I'd have to learn how to "
"struggle... Cope with difficulty and all that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"To be honest, I'm not entirely sure this experience lines up with what she "
"said."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "But I did figure something out! Namely, that weird feeling I've been havin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Yeah! You see, I've been feelin' like something big's about to happen... "
"Like my perspective on life's about to change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "On one hand, there's so much I don't know about the world..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Yet, on the other hand, I have a lot of great opportunities in front of me. "
"I've come a long way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "So, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "I'm sayin' that all the time we spent together has really helped me grow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"You don't have to give me any credit. All I did was talk, and maybe sip a "
"few drinks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Ahah. I figured you'd say something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "You're... such a humble guy. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "But! That's exactly why I like ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Now, I normally wouldn't do this, but tonight I'll make an exception. Let's "
"go out drinkin', Kiryu-san... Just the two of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "...Will you really be okay drinking alcohol?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Ah, I can handle a <Italic>little</Italic>! And don't worry⑬the place I "
"have in mind is nice. But not so nice we can't get a little loopy, if we "
"want to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Oh? Where is this place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"You'll just have to come and find out. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> So let me get the check real quick "
"and we can bust on outta here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Kiryu-san. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"I wanna show ya my appreciation for everything you've done for me... in a "
"way I think you'll appreciate. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> Hope "
"you're ready for the time of your life. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255"
">⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

